# Fase 3 — Manajemen Event & Kejuaraan

Sistem pengelolaan event multisport (PORKAB, Kejurkab, kualifikasi Porprov).

---

## Task Checklist

### 3.1 Manajemen Event
- [ ] Prisma model: `Event`, `EventSchedule`, `MatchResult`, `MedalTally`
- [ ] CRUD API event: `GET/POST/PATCH /api/v1/events`
- [ ] Tipe event: PORKAB, PORPROV, KEJURKAB, OTHER
- [ ] Status event: UPCOMING → ONGOING → COMPLETED / CANCELLED
- [ ] Jadwal pertandingan per cabor dan nomor tanding
- [ ] Manajemen venue dan lokasi

### 3.2 Portal Pendaftaran Event Online
- [ ] Endpoint: `POST /api/v1/events/:id/register`
- [ ] Entry by Name: Admin Cabor mendaftarkan atlet ke nomor tanding
- [ ] Entry by Number: mendaftarkan tim/kontingen
- [ ] Batas waktu pendaftaran dengan validasi deadline
- [ ] Status pendaftaran real-time (open/closed/full)
- [ ] Konfirmasi pendaftaran via email (Nodemailer)
- [ ] Frontend: halaman pendaftaran event untuk Admin Cabor

### 3.3 Live Scoring & Hasil Pertandingan
- [ ] Install Socket.IO untuk WebSocket real-time
- [ ] Namespace: `/events/:eventId` untuk isolasi per event
- [ ] Room: `/events/:eventId/cabor/:caborId` per cabor
- [ ] Event `score:updated` → skor pertandingan diperbarui
- [ ] Event `medal:updated` → klasemen medali diperbarui
- [ ] Event `schedule:changed` → jadwal berubah
- [ ] Event `event:status` → status event berubah
- [ ] Input hasil pertandingan oleh operator (SUPER_ADMIN)
- [ ] Bagan turnamen (bracket) untuk olahraga knockout
- [ ] Tampilan real-time hasil untuk publik

### 3.4 Klasemen Medali
- [ ] Klasemen per kecamatan (untuk PORKAB)
- [ ] Klasemen per cabor
- [ ] Auto-update saat hasil pertandingan di-input
- [ ] Endpoint publik: `GET /api/v1/events/:id/medal-tally`
- [ ] Export klasemen ke Excel (xlsx)
- [ ] Export klasemen ke PDF

### 3.5 Frontend Event Pages
- [ ] Halaman daftar event publik (`/events`)
- [ ] Halaman detail event (`/events/:id`)
- [ ] Live scoreboard publik (`/events/:id/live`)
- [ ] Klasemen medali publik (`/events/:id/medals`)
- [ ] Admin: form buat/edit event
- [ ] Admin: input hasil pertandingan
- [ ] Admin: manajemen pendaftaran

### 3.6 Verifikasi
- [ ] Event CRUD berfungsi end-to-end
- [ ] Pendaftaran atlet ke event berhasil + notifikasi email
- [ ] WebSocket live scoring: update skor → broadcast ke semua viewer
- [ ] Klasemen medali auto-update setelah input hasil
- [ ] Export Excel/PDF menghasilkan file yang valid

---

## Implementation Plan

### Database Models

#### [MODIFY] `prisma/schema.prisma`

Tambah model baru:

```prisma
model Event {
  id              String   @id @default(cuid())
  name            String                          // "PORKAB 2025"
  type            EventType                       // PORKAB | PORPROV | KEJURKAB | OTHER
  description     String?
  startDate       DateTime
  endDate         DateTime
  venue           String
  status          EventStatus @default(UPCOMING)  // UPCOMING | ONGOING | COMPLETED | CANCELLED
  registDeadline  DateTime
  registrations   EventRegistration[]
  schedules       EventSchedule[]
  results         MatchResult[]
  medalTallies    MedalTally[]
}

model EventRegistration {
  id         String   @id @default(cuid())
  eventId    String
  athleteId  String
  caborId    String
  matchNumber String?                           // nomor tanding
  status     RegistStatus @default(PENDING)     // PENDING | CONFIRMED | CANCELLED
}

model EventSchedule {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  eventId   String
  caborId   String
  matchName String
  startTime DateTime
  venue     String
  status    ScheduleStatus @default(SCHEDULED)
}

model MatchResult {
  id        String   @id @default(cuid())
  eventId   String
  caborId   String
  matchName String
  gold      String?    // athlete/team name
  silver    String?
  bronze    String?
}

model MedalTally {
  id         String   @id @default(cuid())
  eventId    String
  entityType String   // "KECAMATAN" | "CABOR"
  entityName String
  gold       Int @default(0)
  silver     Int @default(0)
  bronze     Int @default(0)
}
```

---

### WebSocket (Socket.IO)

#### [NEW] `apps/api/src/socket.ts`

```typescript
// Socket.IO server setup
// Namespace: /events/:eventId
// Events emitted:
//   score:updated   → { matchId, score, timestamp }
//   medal:updated   → { eventId, tally[] }
//   schedule:changed → { matchId, newTime, venue }
//   event:status    → { eventId, status }
```

---

### API Routes

#### [NEW] `apps/api/src/routes/events.ts`

```
GET    /api/v1/events                    → list events (filter: status, type) [PUBLIC]
POST   /api/v1/events                    → create event [SUPER_ADMIN]
GET    /api/v1/events/:id                → detail + jadwal [PUBLIC]
PATCH  /api/v1/events/:id                → update event [SUPER_ADMIN]
POST   /api/v1/events/:id/register       → daftarkan atlet [CABOR_ADMIN+]
GET    /api/v1/events/:id/registrations  → list pendaftar [CABOR_ADMIN+]
POST   /api/v1/events/:id/results        → input hasil [SUPER_ADMIN]
GET    /api/v1/events/:id/medal-tally    → klasemen medali [PUBLIC]
PATCH  /api/v1/events/:id/medal-tally    → update klasemen [SUPER_ADMIN]
GET    /api/v1/events/:id/export/excel   → export Excel [ADMIN+]
GET    /api/v1/events/:id/export/pdf     → export PDF [ADMIN+]
```

