## Verification Plan

| Test | Cara Verifikasi |
|------|----------------|
| Event CRUD | Buat event → lihat detail → edit → status berubah |
| Pendaftaran | Admin Cabor daftarkan atlet → status confirmed → email terkirim |
| Live Scoring | Input skor → WebSocket broadcast → scoreboard publik update real-time |
| Medal Tally | Input hasil emas → klasemen auto-update → ranking berubah |
| Export | Download Excel/PDF → buka file → data akurat |
